Upstream audit
--------------
FFmpeg master checked: 03dc244a693ce639cebf82f7bae112fb75580919
The master ff_mediacodec_dec_receive() still returns EAGAIN after transient
output-format/output-buffer events or a one-second TRY_AGAIN during drain.
No equivalent fix was present in official master or its MediaCodec history.

